      "description": "Nokomis Energy, LLC is a Minneapolis-based distributed-solar developer founded in 2017. Great Bay Renewables closed a royalty-financing transaction in June 2024 through Nokomis Bay LLC, a separate holding company jointly held by Great Bay and Nokomis. Great Bay received Class R units in that royalty structure, project-level gross-revenue royalties, and unexercised warrants permitting a future acquisition of up to 10% of Nokomis Energy. Reviewed public sources do not establish exercise of the warrants or current direct Apollo ownership of Nokomis Energy. Apollo-managed funds sold their upstream 50% Great Bay interest to Northampton Capital Partners on July 30, 2026. Because the manager exposure was indirect royalty financing rather than direct company ownership, Nokomis is excluded from the manager-level PortCo census.",
